# Canonical Nord-derived palette — the single source of truth for every
# tool-specific theme (nvim, tmux, ghostty) generated by this repo.
#
# Key names deliberately match the schema already used by mynord.nvim's
# `colors/mynord.lua` / `colors/mynordlight.lua`, so these tables can be
# handed to `require("mynord").setup({ custom_colors = ... })` as-is.
# The hex *values* here are independent of mynord.nvim though — closer to
# the original Nord palette (nordtheme.com) than mynord's One Dark-shifted
# variant.
